# Every dotfile, at any depth, is ignored unless named below (the operator,
# 2026-10-05: a token or key dropped beside the tree must never be staged).
# That covers the shell's exports (.envrc), every dot-named credential file,
# .terraform/, the plugin cache and editor residue without naming them.
.*
!.gitignore
!.github
!.githooks
!.csis-version
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
# Credential files that are not dotfiles: never committed
*.pem
# The private mirror: the plaintext an execution runs from
_private
# Tool residue and the run-local files; generated/ itself IS committed (a
# --commit run stages meta-state/ and generated/)
**/target/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
tfplan
*.tfvars
!generated/bootstrap/bootstrap.auto.tfvars
YAML_DUMP.yaml
__pycache__/
